  title="How Long Is the Flu Contagious? Complete Timeline"
  description="How long are you contagious with the flu? Learn the full timeline — from before symptoms appear through recovery. When is it safe to return to work or school?"
  publishDate="2026-07-29"
  lastReviewed="2026-07-29"
